WEBVTT

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.740
It wasn't the men.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:20.240
Then who is the thirteenth maiden?

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:25.740
She must be someone close to me, 
who always assists me from behind the scenes.

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:27.000
Mana?!

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:32.460
No, someone that lewd couldn't 
possibly be a maiden.

00:00:33.240 --> 00:00:37.930
Wait... Maybe the lewdness 
makes her a special maiden?

00:00:37.930 --> 00:00:39.040
Say what?!

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:41.140
But Mana's so fat.

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:43.560
Even I can't go for that.

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:47.710
Y-You're so mean... You've broken my heart!

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:49.900
You'll pay for this, Itsuki!

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:52.480
But I'll definitely find her!

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:54.840
After all, there's always only one truth!

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:56.580
I'll make my grandpa proud!

00:00:57.450 --> 00:00:59.690
You've got so many things wrong.

00:00:59.690 --> 00:01:03.070
I don't even feel like correcting you.

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:07.870
In any case, you have to clear 
the twelfth labyrinth first!

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:08.960
Right...

00:02:51.380 --> 00:02:52.980
She got me!

00:02:53.880 --> 00:02:55.940
Uh, when this happens...

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:57.440
T-Treat his wound!

00:02:57.440 --> 00:02:58.690
You fool!

00:02:59.050 --> 00:03:00.240
That's not it!

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:01.470
When this happens...

00:03:01.470 --> 00:03:05.080
You rookies! Don't make me repeat myself!

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:08.080
You have to play your role!

00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:11.790
Leave the recovery of the 
Visitor to us in the rear,

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:13.460
and the rest of you on the front line

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:16.010
should block the second and third attacks.

00:03:16.010 --> 00:03:19.080
We have to protect the 
Visitor using teamwork!

00:03:19.080 --> 00:03:20.520
Isn't that right, Alfie?

00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:21.930
Y-Yes.

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:23.970
All right, let's try this again!

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:27.850
They're like mini-Alfies.

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:29.850
They're nothing like me!

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:33.730
All right, that's it for today's training.

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:39.950
Geez, Itsuki-san, please don't go easy on them.

00:03:39.950 --> 00:03:44.900
If they are weak, your life will be in danger.

00:03:44.900 --> 00:03:49.290
No, I want them to rest 
and preserve their energy.

00:03:50.050 --> 00:03:53.120
We'll go defeat the twelfth 
Impurity Lord tomorrow.

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:05.190
Is everyone asleep?

00:04:05.590 --> 00:04:07.960
Yes, they're sound asleep.

00:04:09.830 --> 00:04:11.740
I'm praying for your safety.

00:04:12.550 --> 00:04:13.480
Right.

00:04:18.830 --> 00:04:21.450
All right, A Team will be a diversion.

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:24.430
Slip past the Impurity and get behind it.

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:28.390
B Team, attack from the right, 
and C Team, attack from the left.

00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:29.870
I'll go for the finishing blow.

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:31.370
Okay!

00:04:31.840 --> 00:04:35.390
This is the Sagittarius 
Impurity Lord, Tentatores!

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:39.470
It uses many fire-based attacks!

00:04:39.470 --> 00:04:42.420
Watch out for its spear strikes!

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:44.430
Okay, let's do it!

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:58.350
All right! Get around it and attack!

00:04:58.350 --> 00:05:00.270
C Team, follow me!

00:05:07.450 --> 00:05:09.450
Ow...

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:10.700
Sagittarius!

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:11.700
Run!

00:05:15.660 --> 00:05:16.950
Are you all right?

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:21.100
Visitor-sama, don't mind me—

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:22.600
We'll all go back together!

00:05:22.600 --> 00:05:24.420
I'm not leaving anyone behind!

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:27.300
Over here!

00:05:34.360 --> 00:05:35.890
You're fine now.

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:37.000
Thanks.

00:05:37.490 --> 00:05:38.960
I'm so relieved!

00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:40.890
There's no time to cry.

00:05:40.890 --> 00:05:43.530
It's going to be okay. 
Remember your training.

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:44.400
Okay!

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:54.160
This is the end!

00:06:06.140 --> 00:06:07.740
It's over.

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:11.470
Itsuki, that was an impressive fight.

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:14.330
This is the end of a long battle.

00:06:14.820 --> 00:06:17.020
Huh? This is strange.

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:18.320
What's going on?

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:20.310
Nothing is happening.

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:26.360
What exactly is going on?

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:36.700
Wh-What's this light?!

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:48.840
We can't return yet, as I thought.

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:08.060
Why? Why did nothing happen?

00:07:08.060 --> 00:07:10.640
Unfortunately, it seems we were unable

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:12.820
to prevent the revival of the thirteenth phantom.

00:07:12.820 --> 00:07:14.320
Then, you mean...

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:19.580
Yes, but fortunately the 
entrance is still sealed.

00:07:20.060 --> 00:07:24.080
Itsuki, you must find the thirteenth 
maiden as soon as possible

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:27.360
and prepare for the final battle.

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:28.350
Yes, sir!

00:07:28.350 --> 00:07:29.400
Let's go, Mana.

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:30.470
Yeah.

00:07:34.910 --> 00:07:37.220
Mirei-chan, what brings you here?

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:41.290
The thirteenth labyrinth appeared earlier.

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:43.450
That's why I was worried about you...

00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:45.230
Sorry, I'm in a rush.

00:07:46.390 --> 00:07:50.090
I have to prepare to see Itsuki-san.

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:04.000
The day to use this has finally come.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:08.000
<b>Maiden's Charm
 My Birthday</b>

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:08.000
A special magic book I obtained from Sola.

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:13.860
I'm sure Itsuki-san will finally 
realize I'm the thirteenth maiden.

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:18.680
Tie this to a bow knot, and...

00:08:16.430 --> 00:08:18.680
*Effect may vary by user.

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:21.380
<i>Now's the chance!</i>

00:08:24.870 --> 00:08:27.690
If no one notices it for three days...

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:29.390
What the heck is this?

00:08:29.390 --> 00:08:31.720
There's some trash on your back.

00:08:32.520 --> 00:08:34.240
What is this?!

00:08:34.240 --> 00:08:36.570
How creepy. Could it be some kind of curse?

00:08:36.830 --> 00:08:38.640
Stay away!

00:08:38.640 --> 00:08:40.260
Who could've done something like that?

00:08:44.880 --> 00:08:46.710
This one next!

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:49.630
<b>Itsuki Loves Alfie</b>

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:50.490
If I can finish using this eraser
 without anyone touching it,

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:52.550
*This is merely a personal opinion.

00:08:50.490 --> 00:08:52.550
I'm sure Itsuki-san will...

00:08:54.930 --> 00:08:57.800
Good! I should be able to 
finish this right away!

00:08:57.800 --> 00:09:00.310
Alfie! A delivery for you!

00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:03.310
Here, please give me your stamp or signature!

00:09:03.690 --> 00:09:06.000
I don't have my stamp here, so I'll sign.

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:07.810
Right over there, please.

00:09:07.810 --> 00:09:11.340
You're using a pencil! Please use a pen!

00:09:11.340 --> 00:09:13.210
Oh, sorry.

00:09:13.210 --> 00:09:15.320
Let's see... here it is—

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:25.710
I have no choice, it's time for <i>that</i> one!

00:09:24.830 --> 00:09:27.210
<b>Itsuki LOVE</b>

00:09:25.710 --> 00:09:27.210
Write down the name of the person I like...

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:28.210
rip it in half...

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:29.210
roll it up...

00:09:29.210 --> 00:09:31.030
and swallow!

00:09:38.240 --> 00:09:40.600
I can't... do this...

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:42.970
I have to tell him in person.

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:47.050
I'm looking for the thirteenth maiden!

00:09:47.050 --> 00:09:52.030
It's a once a lifetime opportunity 
to be the thirteenth maiden!

00:09:52.030 --> 00:09:56.740
Did this emblem appear on an 
innocent virgin out there?

00:09:56.740 --> 00:09:59.660
Come out now and engage in

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:03.680
a sweaty and sensual 
Love Ritual with this Visitor!

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:07.560
Don't worry, I have already 
researched all the sensitive spots

00:10:07.560 --> 00:10:10.720
that would make Itsuki happy!

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:12.540
Itsuki-san!

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:18.200
I thought I just heard Alfie's voice...

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:19.440
You must have imagined it.

00:10:19.440 --> 00:10:20.630
Let's hurry.

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:24.510
Is the thirteenth maiden out there?

00:10:24.510 --> 00:10:28.280
We're looking for the 
girl who has this emblem!

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:33.150
The thirteenth maiden will be the 
first in hundreds of years!

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:35.550
So, if you come out now,

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:40.240
I'll give you my handmade see-through 
pink negligee as a present!

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:42.200
You can almost see the important parts,
 but not quite!

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:44.620
It's super-duper sexy!

00:10:44.620 --> 00:10:47.200
Of course, it's a limited 
edition that's not for sale!

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:50.170
Itsuki-san, um...

00:10:52.820 --> 00:10:54.200
What is it?

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:57.790
I was just impressed with 
how popular Seiya is.

00:10:57.790 --> 00:10:59.820
Maybe I had the wrong idea about him.

00:10:59.820 --> 00:11:02.360
Well, I guess so.

00:11:03.780 --> 00:11:06.880
Is the thirteenth maiden out there?

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:11.690
We're looking for a beautiful 
young girl who has this emblem!

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:16.090
What was that? What did you just say now?

00:11:16.090 --> 00:11:18.990
The Visitor is having impure thoughts!

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:20.760
That's why she won't show up!

00:11:20.760 --> 00:11:25.050
Itsuki-san! I'm the thirteenth...

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:30.760
This place is too noisy.

00:11:30.760 --> 00:11:32.140
Let's go somewhere else.

00:11:32.140 --> 00:11:33.690
Yeah.

00:11:36.040 --> 00:11:39.530
P-Please... Wait...

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:45.970
No! I failed again!

00:11:46.380 --> 00:11:48.220
I need a strong charm—

00:11:48.220 --> 00:11:50.720
What the hell are you doing?!

00:11:50.720 --> 00:11:53.070
We were waiting forever, 
and you didn't show up,

00:11:53.070 --> 00:11:54.160
so I came to check on you.

00:11:54.160 --> 00:11:57.390
I never thought you'd be using 
some useless good luck charm!

00:11:57.390 --> 00:12:00.340
Start acting like a real maiden, 
and let yourself be known!

00:12:00.980 --> 00:12:02.860
How did you know that I'm a maiden?

00:12:03.150 --> 00:12:07.560
Some people said there was a girl who 
was screaming she was the thirteenth maiden,

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:10.790
and the girl they described 
couldn't have been anyone but you!

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:13.880
Come on, let's go see Itsuki now.

00:12:13.880 --> 00:12:14.790
No!

00:12:14.790 --> 00:12:16.440
What are you doing?

00:12:16.920 --> 00:12:17.770
No.

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:19.640
Why not?

00:12:20.200 --> 00:12:25.530
Encounters have to be sudden... or trendy!

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:32.310
<i>Dear Alfie</i>

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:32.310
<i>from Otabito's
 Diary</i>

00:12:26.810 --> 00:12:30.300
My father left me this.

00:12:30.300 --> 00:12:32.310
A videotape?

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:36.120
He said I have to show it to the Visitor,

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:38.940
if I am to become a maiden.

00:12:39.460 --> 00:12:42.220
Do I have to show that to Itsuki?

00:12:44.760 --> 00:12:47.260
Uh, um...

00:12:52.130 --> 00:12:54.200
It was her, after all!

00:12:54.200 --> 00:12:57.460
Well, I knew it from the start.

00:12:57.460 --> 00:12:58.650
Liar.

00:12:58.650 --> 00:13:02.710
It was obvious that the thirteenth maiden 
couldn't be anyone but Alfie!

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:05.720
I've kept quiet all this time, 
but take a look at the OP!

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:06.620
Here.

00:13:06.620 --> 00:13:07.770
Oh, you're right!

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:10.810
Everyone else knew too, right?

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:13.150
Only you didn't.

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:14.350
Who's "everybody"?

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:15.600
Don't worry about it.

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:18.440
Anyway, she gave me this.

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:23.620
Apparently, you can get the hint for 
deepening your bond if you watch this.

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:45.010
<i>Even if the earth starts spinning the 
other way around, we won't be separated!</i>

00:13:45.010 --> 00:13:46.680
<i>Of course!</i>

00:13:46.680 --> 00:13:50.510
<i>You would chase me to the end of 
the universe, even if I ran away!</i>

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:02.200
<i>I will never forgive you!</i>

00:14:02.200 --> 00:14:03.150
<i>Let go of me.</i>

00:14:11.000 --> 00:14:13.410
Wh-What is this?

00:14:14.840 --> 00:14:16.510
It's so wonderful!

00:14:16.510 --> 00:14:21.400
I want to be in a cool, trendy, 
lovey-dovey show like this!

00:14:21.400 --> 00:14:23.170
I want to watch more of it!

00:14:23.170 --> 00:14:25.210
Sorry, I can't...

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:26.680
You fool!

00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:28.640
You can't see how good this drama series is?

00:14:28.640 --> 00:14:30.250
You're so lame!

00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:31.990
How can you expect to catch my heart—

00:14:32.710 --> 00:14:36.420
Catch Alfie's heart like that?

00:14:37.430 --> 00:14:41.320
Alfie wants a trendy romance,

00:14:41.320 --> 00:14:43.850
so shut your trap, and make it trendy!

00:14:43.850 --> 00:14:46.190
Trendy is the best!

00:15:01.430 --> 00:15:03.490
What a beautiful sunset.

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:04.590
Yeah.

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:10.810
An Italian dinner next, and the present 
will be a heart-shaped necklace.

00:15:10.810 --> 00:15:13.930
Alfie is practically already seduced!

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:17.100
I'm a genius for coming up with this plan.

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:29.490
That was delicious!

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:31.420
I'm glad.

00:15:31.940 --> 00:15:35.500
Sorry, Mana, but please 
return to the foster home.

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:37.240
Huh? What about the present?

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:40.380
Are you sure about this?

00:15:40.380 --> 00:15:42.000
Yeah, thanks.

00:15:42.820 --> 00:15:45.500
Don't blame me if you fail!

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:48.250
Wow, what a collection!

00:15:48.250 --> 00:15:50.260
P-Please don't stare like that.

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:52.090
Sorry for barging in.

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:55.120
I'm sure you would've 
preferred a trendy date.

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:57.180
It's all right! It's fine!

00:15:57.180 --> 00:15:59.020
That was enough.

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:03.270
I realized that I didn't want to 
be part of a made-up drama show.

00:16:03.530 --> 00:16:06.790
I wanted to know more about the real you.

00:16:08.290 --> 00:16:11.900
Your bond won't deepen one bit 
from lame conversation like that!

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:15.480
Alfie said she wanted a trendy date!

00:16:15.480 --> 00:16:18.430
An at-home date is the polar 
opposite of bubble-era dates!

00:16:18.430 --> 00:16:20.790
It's boring! Boring as hell!

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:25.730
But why do you like idols from Sola?

00:16:25.730 --> 00:16:27.720
The ones from many years ago, too.

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:29.940
Actually, my parents...

00:16:31.090 --> 00:16:33.050
They're from this world though, right?

00:16:33.050 --> 00:16:37.300
Anyway, what are your parents like?

00:16:37.300 --> 00:16:41.720
They must both be really 
worried with you disappearing.

00:16:41.720 --> 00:16:43.940
You haven't heard from Mana about them?

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:46.600
No, I haven't.

00:16:46.600 --> 00:16:50.190
Actually, they passed away in an accident.

00:16:51.170 --> 00:16:54.010
I... um...

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:55.950
I'm sorry, Itsuki-san.

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:57.690
It's all right.

00:16:57.690 --> 00:17:01.530
I'm already over it, 
so don't feel bad.

00:17:01.530 --> 00:17:02.590
But...

00:17:02.590 --> 00:17:03.930
It's fine.

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:07.710
All right, then...

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:32.390
...that pretty much sums it up.

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:36.740
I was going to listen to your stories, 
but I ended up talking the whole time.

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:43.310
Uh, um...

00:17:43.310 --> 00:17:45.870
What kind of books do you usually read?

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:52.130
Well, I guess about entertainment, 
martial arts, and...

00:17:53.080 --> 00:17:55.030
This one's a secret.

00:17:56.130 --> 00:18:00.480
Tsk! Itsuki would've seen 
the deceitful woman she is,

00:18:00.480 --> 00:18:05.750
for using some Sola magic 
to capture his heart!

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:09.150
Huh? Whose side am I on?

00:18:09.550 --> 00:18:11.040
Huh? What's this?

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:12.780
That's...

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:18.150
<b>Visitor Secret Project</b>

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:18.150
<b>Put your life at stake 
to protect the Visitor</b>

00:18:12.780 --> 00:18:15.180
Visitor Secret Project...

00:18:15.180 --> 00:18:18.150
Put your life at stake to
 protect the Visitor...

00:18:18.570 --> 00:18:21.160
Um... That is...

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:21.160
<b>Libra</b>

00:18:21.490 --> 00:18:23.660
<b>Leo</b>

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:25.370
<b>A Team</b>

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:25.580
<b>B Team</b>

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:26.000
<b>Visitor-sama</b>

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:25.800
Incredible.

00:18:30.160 --> 00:18:32.540
Thank you, Alfie.

00:18:32.540 --> 00:18:37.430
To be honest, I was worried if I would 
ever be able to return home alive.

00:18:37.430 --> 00:18:42.320
But you were protecting me
 this whole time.

00:18:42.320 --> 00:18:46.310
No, we're the ones being protected.

00:18:46.310 --> 00:18:49.850
This must be why I never felt alone

00:18:49.850 --> 00:18:52.810
when I was in the labyrinth.

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:58.080
I'm the one who's looking 
after you 24 hours a day!

00:18:58.080 --> 00:19:02.070
You can't even go on a 
single date without me!

00:19:03.880 --> 00:19:04.840
Alfie...

00:19:04.840 --> 00:19:06.470
Yes?

00:19:07.940 --> 00:19:11.870
Please, don't look at me like that...

00:19:11.870 --> 00:19:13.080
You're making me nervous.

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:14.140
Why?

00:19:14.140 --> 00:19:15.820
Well...

00:19:15.820 --> 00:19:17.670
I want to look at you more.

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:24.700
I prepared something because 
I wanted to deepen our bond.

00:19:25.270 --> 00:19:27.750
Although... I'm not sure if you'll like it.

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:32.060
It's so wonderful!

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:34.240
I feel bad for saying this to your father,

00:19:34.240 --> 00:19:36.970
but I think the pure idol 
image suits you better

00:19:36.970 --> 00:19:40.110
than a trendy idol from the past.

00:19:40.110 --> 00:19:45.080
This is the happiest moment of my life.

00:19:51.620 --> 00:19:56.650
You would chase me to the end of 
the universe, even if I ran away!

00:19:56.650 --> 00:19:58.200
That's a bit scary.

00:19:58.630 --> 00:20:02.720
I didn't know that dress was a present!

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:06.410
I thought Itsuki was going to use it
 himself for an <i>alternative</i> hobby,

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:11.210
and that's why I burned the midnight oil 
to place every stitch with care!

00:20:11.210 --> 00:20:14.410
And you two spinning around 
in front of me like that...

00:20:14.410 --> 00:20:21.900
I should be the Cinderella 
dancing around in there!

00:20:22.190 --> 00:20:24.730
Alfie, I want you to have my child,

00:20:24.730 --> 00:20:26.440
and raise her to become strong.

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:28.920
Yes, please leave it to me.

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:33.850
What's wrong, Alfie?

00:20:33.850 --> 00:20:35.910
My stomach...

00:20:35.910 --> 00:20:40.010
I... may not be able to make it...

00:20:42.950 --> 00:20:43.900
Alfie?

00:20:43.900 --> 00:20:44.890
Get yourself together!

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:47.020
Alfie? Alfie?!

00:20:48.340 --> 00:20:49.640
Don't worry.

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:51.530
It wasd just some loose bowels.

00:20:51.530 --> 00:20:53.690
It seems she swallowed some paper.

00:20:54.010 --> 00:20:58.440
I wonder if her brain is also made of muscle.

00:20:58.440 --> 00:21:02.520
They say love is blind, and I guess

00:21:02.520 --> 00:21:05.200
that can even make you 
believe in foolish charms.

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:09.550
How careless of a girl like me to forget...

00:21:09.550 --> 00:21:13.960
but I guess I'll wait a bit longer 
before I give this to her.

00:21:11.200 --> 00:21:13.960
<b>Stomach 
Pain 
 Medicine</b>

00:21:31.940 --> 00:21:34.180
Wh-What do you think?

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:36.940
It looks really good on you.

00:21:36.940 --> 00:21:40.890
You're making me blush!

00:21:40.890 --> 00:21:41.830
But...

00:21:42.980 --> 00:21:46.220
I only want you to wear it for me.

00:21:47.590 --> 00:21:49.910
I don't want anyone else to see it.

00:21:50.320 --> 00:21:53.340
Alfie, please have my child.

00:21:53.760 --> 00:21:54.950
Yes.

00:21:57.460 --> 00:21:59.960
<b>My Children, Thirteen of Them!?</b>

00:23:32.470 --> 00:23:39.980
Are You Going to Tell Me That 
You Want Me to Have Your Child

00:23:37.460 --> 00:23:39.160
Ikkun.
